558
00:32:55,287 --> 00:32:57,664
[mengerang, bernapas berat]

559
00:32:57,747 --> 00:32:59,874
[Dahye] Aku dengar Seyeon yang berada di baliknya.

560
00:33:00,583 --> 00:33:02,544
