586
00:34:10,737 --> 00:34:13,698
Dialah yang sebenarnya membenci Seyeon.

587
00:34:16,534 --> 00:34:17,827
MAHASISWA TARI TAHUN KETIGA
SONG GAEUN

588
00:34:17,911 --> 00:34:18,953
[Isoo] Coba buka.

589
00:34:19,037 --> 00:34:20,538
